{"level":30,"time":1776954216365,"pid":39427,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"3.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017YhJk3ooBZ4N3yihQX6P3s","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Site Plan: Valley View Townhomes\n     2→\n     3→**Site Address:** N/A\n     4→**Site Plan Number:** N/A\n     5→**Zoning:** N/A\n     6→\n     7→## Primary Site Plan (39 sheets)\n     8→\n     9→**Document ID (for vision tool):** `1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777`\n    10→\n    11→### Sheet Index\n    12→\n    13→- **Sheet 1 [Cover]:** Cover sheet containing project details, location map, and sheet index. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-01/guide.md`\n    14→- **Sheet 2 [Plat]:** Subdivision plat map showing legal boundaries, easements, and signatures. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-02/guide.md`\n    15→- **Sheet 3 [General Notes]:** Comprehensive general notes, sequence of construction, and project legend. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-03/guide.md`\n    16→- **Sheet 4 [Existing Conditions Survey]:** Topographic survey detailing existing structures, trees, and property boundaries. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-04/guide.md`\n    17→- **Sheet 5 [Erosion and Sedimentation Control Plan]:** Site layout detailing erosion and sedimentation control measures. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-05/guide.md`\n    18→- **Sheet 6 [Erosion Control Notes]:** Contains erosion control, tree protection, and special construction notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-06/guide.md`\n    19→- **Sheet 7 [Erosion Control Details]:** Standard details and specifications for erosion and sediment control. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-07/guide.md`\n    20→- **Sheet 8 [Tree Removal & Demolition Plan]:** Site plan detailing existing structure demolition and tree removal. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-08/guide.md`\n    21→- **Sheet 9 [Site Plan]:** Detailed site plan layout with associated building and parking data. → `primary-site-plan/sheet