{"level":30,"time":1776954222414,"pid":39427,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FAnUBLuYTTGY88yGqwZTs3","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Site Plan: Valley View Townhomes\n     2→\n     3→**Site Address:** N/A\n     4→**Site Plan Number:** N/A\n     5→**Zoning:** N/A\n     6→\n     7→## Primary Site Plan (39 sheets)\n     8→\n     9→**Document ID (for vision tool):** `1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777`\n    10→\n    11→### Sheet Index\n    12→\n    13→- **Sheet 1 [Cover]:** Cover sheet containing project details, location map, and sheet index. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-01/guide.md`\n    14→- **Sheet 2 [Plat]:** Subdivision plat map showing legal boundaries, easements, and signatures. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-02/guide.md`\n    15→- **Sheet 3 [General Notes]:** Comprehensive general notes, sequence of construction, and project legend. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-03/guide.md`\n    16→- **Sheet 4 [Existing Conditions Survey]:** Topographic survey detailing existing structures, trees, and property boundaries. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-04/guide.md`\n    17→- **Sheet 5 [Erosion and Sedimentation Control Plan]:** Site layout detailing erosion and sedimentation control measures. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-05/guide.md`\n    18→- **Sheet 6 [Erosion Control Notes]:** Contains erosion control, tree protection, and special construction notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-06/guide.md`\n    19→- **Sheet 7 [Erosion Control Details]:** Standard details and specifications for erosion and sediment control. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-07/guide.md`\n    20→- **Sheet 8 [Tree Removal & Demolition Plan]:** Site plan detailing existing structure demolition and tree removal. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-08/guide.md`\n    21→- **Sheet 9 [Site Plan]:** Detailed site plan layout with associated building and parking data. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-09/guide.md`\n    22→- **Sheet 10 [Fire Protection Plan]:** Site plan illustrating fire lanes, hydrants, and fire zone details. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-10/guide.md`\n    23→- **Sheet 11 [Grading Plan]:** This sheet displays the detailed grading plan for the development site. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-11/guide.md`\n    24→- **Sheet 12 [Storm Sewer Plan]:** Displays the proposed storm sewer layout and drainage infrastructure details. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-12/guide.md`\n    25→- **Sheet 13 [Drainage Area Map]:** Existing and proposed drainage area maps with summary tables. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-13/guide.md`\n    26→- **Sheet 14 [Inlet Drainage Area Map]:** Site drainage area map and rational method runoff calculations. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-14/guide.md`\n    27→- **Sheet 15 [Biofiltration-Detention Pond Plan & Calculations]:** Biofiltration and detention pond plan, details, and engineering calculations. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-15/guide.md`\n    28→- **Sheet 16 [Biofiltration-Detention Pond Profiles]:** Biofiltration pond profiles, outfall details, and comprehensive maintenance requirements. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-16/guide.md`\n    29→- **Sheet 17 [Conveyance Cross Sections]:** Conveyance cross-section graphs and corresponding site plan view. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-17/guide.md`\n    30→- **Sheet 18 [Austin Water General Information & Construction Notes]:** Austin Water general information, construction notes, and flow tests. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-18/guide.md`\n    31→- **Sheet 19 [Utility Tap Plan]:** Utility tap plan showing proposed water and wastewater connections. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-19/guide.md`\n    32→- **Sheet 20 [Utility Tap Public Plan & Profile]:** Utility tap public plan and profile for townhomes project. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-20/guide.md`\n    33→- **Sheet 21 [Preliminary Electrical Design Plan]:** Layout of preliminary electrical design, routing, transformers, and meters. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-21/guide.md`\n    34→- **Sheet 22 [Construction Details 1]:** Construction details for curbs, sidewalks, driveways, and bicycle parking. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-22/guide.md`\n    35→- **Sheet 23 [Construction Details 2]:** Standard construction details for water infrastructure, valves, and fire hydrants. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-23/guide.md`\n    36→- **Sheet 24 [Construction Details 3]:** Standard construction details for water services and trench repairs. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-24/guide.md`\n    37→- **Sheet 25 [Construction Details 4]:** Standard details, plan, and section views for fire line meters. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-25/guide.md`\n    38→- **Sheet 26 [Construction Details 5]:** Standard details for wastewater service connections and sewer cleanouts. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-26/guide.md`\n    39→- **Sheet 27 [Construction Details 6]:** Construction details for wastewater manholes and duplex grinder pumps. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-27/guide.md`\n    40→- **Sheet 28 [Construction Details 7]:** Construction details for storm drain manholes and catch basins. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-28/guide.md`\n    41→- **Sheet 29 [Addressing Plan]:** Site plan showing building layouts and individual unit addresses. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-29/guide.md`\n    42→- **Sheet 30 [Existing Tree Plan]:** Site plan displaying existing trees, protection measures, and care notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-30/guide.md`\n    43→- **Sheet 31 [Landscape Plan]:** Landscape design plan featuring planting details and irrigation notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-31/guide.md`\n    44→- **Sheet 32 [Tree List]:** This page provides a detailed list of surveyed trees. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-32/guide.md`\n    45→- **Sheet 33 [Canopy Impact Exhibit]:** Exhibits detailing tree canopy calculations and construction impact analysis. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-33/guide.md`\n    46→- **Sheet 34 [Root Zone Impact Exhibit]:** Critical root zone impact diagrams, calculations, and tree photos. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-34/guide.md`\n    47→- **Sheet 35 [Landscape Calculations]:** Provides landscape calculations, plant lists, and tree preservation notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-35/guide.md`\n    48→- **Sheet 36 [Biofiltration Pond Plans & Calculations]:** Detailed planting plans and calculations for the biofiltration pond. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-36/guide.md`\n    49→- **Sheet 37 [Landscape Details]:** Contains landscape details for tree planting, tree protection, and shrubs. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-37/guide.md`\n    50→- **Sheet 38 [Wall Plan]:** Plan view, section details, and notes for retaining walls. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-38/guide.md`\n    51→- **Sheet 39 [Wall Plan Details And Notes]:** Details and cross-sections for multiple pond retaining walls. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-39/guide.md`\n    52→\n    53→## Supplementary Documents\n    54→\n    55→1. **Erosion Control Fiscal Estimate** (documentId: `e77f8b2c-e37c-41b5-8c16-0319b3c00cda`) — An engineer's cost estimate for erosion and sedimentation controls required for the project site. → `supplementary-docs/erosion-control-fiscal-estimate/overview.md`\n    56→2. **Consolidated Site Plan Application** (documentId: `2fa9891b-9ede-4030-9300-cce670e070e1`) — Completeness check submittal for a consolidated site plan permit application in the City of Austin. → `supplementary-docs/consolidated-site-plan-application/overview.md`\n    57→3. **Engineer's Summary Letter** (documentId: `726dac64-638d-4735-8a24-c3e2d243a2b8`) — An engineer's summary letter detailing existing conditions, proposed improvements, and utilities for the project site plan. → `supplementary-docs/engineer-s-summary-letter/overview.md`\n    58→4. **Completeness Check Results** (documentId: `ba9815a3-047c-473a-a152-86ba84aae6d1`) — City of Austin site plan completeness check results detailing reviewer statuses and applicant responses to deficiencies. → `supplementary-docs/completeness-check-results/overview.md`\n    59→5. **Travis County Tax Certificate** (documentId: `cc3df4f3-7134-4ca3-9571-48c0260bfeed`) — Official Travis County document certifying that property taxes for the specified lot are fully paid. → `supplementary-docs/travis-county-tax-certificate/overview.md`\n    60→6. **TIA Determination Worksheet** (documentId: `0dbc90ac-37a5-4a6d-a51f-42b839ecb91b`) — Completed worksheet determining that a traffic impact analysis is not required for the proposed site plan development. → `supplementary-docs/tia-determination-worksheet/overview.md`\n    61→7. **Master Comment Report** (documentId: `ca29fbe6-6361-4580-848e-7807ae462499`) — A comprehensive compilation of city staff review comments requiring updates for a site plan application. → `supplementary-docs/master-comment-report/overview.md`\n    62→8. **Project Review Form** (documentId: `e1c5768d-263b-4500-98ff-f6723ae5876c`) — A completed City of Austin form indicating applicable land development codes and site plan application details for the project. → `supplementary-docs/project-review-form/overview.md`\n    63→9. **Project Location Map** (documentId: `10f3f1b9-e25e-4118-bfe3-08ea287ce738`) — A map displaying the geographical location of the project site relative to surrounding streets and parcels. → `supplementary-docs/project-location-map/overview.md`\n    64→10. **Property Tax Documentation** (documentId: `135639d9-9070-45b5-8b3b-8df3dbb0c795`) — Provides evidence that formal tax certificates have been ordered and confirms zero property taxes are currently due. → `supplementary-docs/property-tax-documentation/overview.md`\n    65→\n    66→## Other Files\n    67→\n    68→- `facts.md` — Surveyed property facts (address, zoning, flood zone, etc.)\n    69→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, o