0","uuid":"a707e22b-a150-49ad-9ca2-7470a5739383","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/supplementary-docs/engineer-s-summary-letter/overview.md","content":"# Engineer's Summary Letter\n\nAn engineer's summary letter detailing existing conditions, proposed improvements, and utilities for the project site plan.\n\n## Sections\n\n1. **Header and Introduction** (p. 1)\n   Document header, addressee, and introductory statement identifying the summary letter for the proposed townhome development.\n   File: `01-header-and-introduction.md`\n2. **General Information** (p. 1)\n   Provides the site location details, including watershed, floodplain status, aquifer zone, and zoning information for the project.\n   File: `02-general-information.md`\n3. **Existing Conditions** (p. 1)\n   Describes the current state of the site, noting existing impervious cover, drainage patterns, and easements.\n   File: `03-existing-conditions.md`\n4. **Proposed Project** (p. 1)\n   Outlines the proposed construction of 39 townhomes, water quality controls, and a reduction in impervious cover.\n   File: `04-proposed-project.md`\n5. **Utilities** (p. 2)\n   Details the planned water and wastewater connections for the project's eight buildings and includes the engineer's sign-off.\n   File: `05-utilities.md`\n","numLines":22,"startLine":1,"totalLines":22}}}
