er than electrical conduit/conductor sizing. It reads exactly as follows:\n    > \"1. Contractor shall verify horizontal and vertical location of existing utilities prior to construction.\"\n    > \"2. Contractor shall verify location of existing line, point of connection and notify engineer of any conflicts/discrepancies prior to installation of improvements.\"\n    > \"3. All Private Domestic Water Branches to the buildings are to be 2\" HDPE service tube per Detail 520-AW-01B\"\n    > \"4. All Private Wastewater Branches to the building are to be 6\" PVC service connections per Detail 520-AW-01C\"\n* **Conduit/Conductor details:** There are no explicit callouts on the blue lines indicating specific electrical conduit sizes (e.g., \"4-inch PVC\"), conductor gauge/type, or trench details on this specific sheet."}]}
