ering firm details, Texas 811 logo, legal description, disclaimers regarding utility locations, and a cross-reference to the landscape plan for trees. READ for general project administration and liability disclaimers if required.\n\n---\n\nAll other block detail in `./blocks.md`\n","numLines":36,"startLine":1,"totalLines":36}}}
