rding Reference:** None found associated with this label on the drawing.\n*   **Location:** Running generally north-south through the middle of LOT 2.\n    *   **Label:** `\"10' Wastewater Ease\"` (Note: The word \"Wastewater\" is slightly blurry but appears to be the intended text based on standard utility naming).\n    *   **Recording Reference:** None found associated with this label.\n\n**3) General Location of Transmission Structures, Towers, or Electric Transmission Easements**\n\nBased on a thorough scan of the document:\n*   There are **no** structures, towers, or easements explicitly labeled with the words \"transmission\" or \"tower\".\n*   The only electric-related easement identified is the `\"Exist 5' Elec. Ease.\"` located along the southern boundary of LOT 1, as detailed in section 1 above.\n\n**4) Boundaries of Lot 1 and Lot 2**\n\nThe boundaries defining LOT 1 and LOT 2 are marked with the following bearing and distance labels along their perimeters:\n\n*   **Northern Boundary:**\n    *   Along LOT 1: `\"S 61° 14' E 419.67'\"`\n    *   Along LOT 2: `\"S 62° 01' E 284.92'\"`\n*   **Eastern Boundary (LOT 2 abutting Clawson Road):**\n    *   Straight line distance labeled as `\"80.64'\"`. (The bearing is difficult to read clearly, appearing roughly as S 15° 24' W).\n    *   The southeast corner features a curve referenced to a table. The exact transcription of this table is as follows:\n\n    **CURVE DATA**\n    Δ = 31° 25'\n    T = 20.84'\n    R = 74.10'\n    L.C. = 40.12'\n    ARC = 40.63'\n\n*   **Southern Boundary:**\n    *   Along LOT 2: `\"N 62° 01' W 289.79'\"`\n    *   Along LOT 1: `\"N 61° 42' W 414.33'\"`\n*   **Western Boundary (LOT 1 abutting Valley View Road):**\n    *   Distance labeled as `\"80.00'\"`.\n*   **Shared interior boundary (dividing LOT 1 and LOT 2):**\n    *   Dashed line with a distance labeled as `\"80.00'\"`.\n\n**5) Valley View Road and Clawson Road Right-of-Way Dedications**\n\n*   **Dedication Statement:** The owner's c