rance dimensions from the proposed transformers to the overhead line\n- NO graphical envelope delineations (7.5-ft horizontal, 15-ft radius clearance zones) shown on plans\n\n\n- NO Austin Energy written clearance approval or site-specific transmission analysis documented\n- NO survey data verifying proximity to AE facilities\n- NO height restrictions marked on the plans\n- NO field verification protocol specified for utility separations\n\nI should systematically work through the checklist items and also review Sheet 8 (Demolition Plan) for any transmission line safety protocols.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1856,"cache_read_input_tokens":57093,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1856},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6e121e67-5008-4f73-b228-82e438cca3a3","uuid":"d9b3d61b-220b-4a9c-af2f-145e40784c34"}
