itted site plan."}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-WlHEaHLSqygb7NB3DrOsKAls","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Thu, 23 Apr 2026 14:27:57 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"cle1::cle1::g6bc9-1776954443571-9a279e82c2f1"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful visual analysis of the provided plat sheet for \"MECEY SUBDIVISION\" (Travis County Plat Volume 73, Page 76, dated 1975), here are the findings regarding your specific questions:\n\n**1. All easement lines shown on the plat & 2. Specific easement labels/descriptions**\nThere are three distinct easement lines denoted by dashed lines on the plat, labeled exactly as follows:\n*   **\"Exist. 5' Elec. Ease.\"**\n*   **\"20' Drainage Easement (Existing)\"**\n*   **\"10' Wastewater Line Easement\"**\n\n**3. The boundaries and dimensions of each easement**\n*   **\"Exist. 5' Elec. Ease.\"**: This is shown as a 5-foot wide strip running horizontally along the entire southern property line of **LOT 1**. The boundary it runs parallel to is dimensioned as `361.42'`.\n*   **\"20' Drainage E