{"level":30,"time":1776954533269,"pid":39427,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"3.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01GoAWtkt9QCD7RXj5rdfJ2e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Review Complete\n\nI have completed the site plan review for **Grouping 3 — Austin Energy Service and ROW Utility Coordination** for the Valley View Townhomes project (SP-2025-0126C).\n\n### Summary of Findings\n\nI evaluated all 32 checklist items in this grouping and identified **7 findings** (5 failures and 2 not-verifiable):\n\n**Failures (5):**\n1. **EL-3.1** - ESPA (Electric Service Planning Application) approval not documented in plan set\n2. **EL-3.4** - Missing note stating site is within Austin Energy service area\n3. **EL-3.5** - Missing note about developer responsibility for conduit/infrastructure to AE standards\n4. **EL-3.9** - Missing preconstruction meeting requirement with Austin Energy for demolition\n5. **EL-3.29** - Additional Review Acknowledgement table not completed on cover sheet\n\n**Not-Verifiable (2):**\n1. **EL-3.2** - AEU clearance letter not located in submittal package\n2. **EL-3.31** - Addressing plan approval status cannot be verified from submitted documents\n\n### What Passed or Was N/A\n\nThe plan includes positive findings:\n- ✓ All four Standard Austin Energy Notes are present verbatim (EL-3.6)\n- ✓ Comprehensive transmission easement notes (EL-3.32)\n- N/A: Great Streets lighting requirements (project outside Great Streets boundary)\n- N/A: Moonlight tower provisions (project in South Austin, outside tower area)\n- N/A: Street light coordination items (no street lights proposed)\n\nThe applicant should address the five failure items on the plan notes (Sheet 3) and cover sheet (Sheet 1), and verify the addressing and utility clearance statuses through appropriate channels before final approval."}],"stop_reason