{"level":30,"time":1776954724187,"pid":39427,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_013vUiuxU8H84jctCxDXPVfu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed my review of the EL-1 grouping (Overhead and Vertical Electrical Clearances) for the Valley View Townhomes site plan. \n\n## Summary of Findings\n\nI identified **6 fail deficiencies** across the site plan:\n\n1. **EL-1.18** - Demolition plan sequence notes are missing required transmission line safety requirements (pre-construction safety meeting, barricades, warning signs, spoils prohibition) that are present in the general notes but should be in the demolition plan\n\n2. **EL-1.22** - The identified staging area shown on the Erosion Control Plan lacks the required 14-ft vertical clearance dimension (the pond exceeds the exemption thresholds)\n\n3. **EL-1.23** - The maintenance path/ramp to the biofiltration pond lacks the required 14-ft vertical clearance dimension (exemption thresholds exceeded)\n\n4. **EL-1.26** - No graphical delineation of the distribution clearance envelope (7.5-ft horizontal and 15-ft radius from outside conductor) or transmission clearance envelope shown on site/utility plans\n\n5. **EL-1.27** - No horizontal dashed height limit lines shown to delineate overhead utility clearance boundaries\n\n6. **EL-1.28** - No sloped or stepped height limit lines shown despite site's non-uniform grades (topography varies ~9 feet across site with overhead utilities on perimeter)\n\nThe site has overhead electric lines along the western and southern perimeters in the right-of-way, transmission facilities referenced in construction notes, and an underground electrical system for the project itself. The primary gaps involve missing clearance delineation graphics and staging area clearance documentation."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4298,"cache_read_input_tokens":86818,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4298},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"401e6f81-2db8-4fbd-be98-34356fe0baff","uuid":"0c8e1199-86a5-4f1f-a557-59c3dd0d016b"}
